#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file nosmartcardbase.ui line 24
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "<b>Unable to contact the KDE smartcard service.</b>"
msgstr "<b>Nie mòże skòntaktowac sã z ùsłëżnotą KDE smartcard.</b>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file nosmartcardbase.ui line 35
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Possible Reasons"
msgstr "Mòżlewé òrądze"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file nosmartcardbase.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"\n"
"1) The KDE daemon, 'kded' is not running. You can restart it by running the "
"command 'kdeinit' and then try reloading the KDE Control Center to see if "
"this message goes away.\n"
"\n"
"2) You don't appear to have smartcard support in the KDE libraries. You will "
"need to recompile the kdelibs package with libpcsclite installed."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1) Demòn KDE 'kded' nie je zrëszony. Mòże gò zrëszëc znowa pòlétã 'kdeinit' "
"ë jesz rôz spróbòwac zrëszëc nen mòduł Centróm kòntrolë.\n"
"\n"
"2) W bibliotekach KDE felëje òbsłëżnotë smartcard. Nót je znowa skòmpilowac "
"kdelibs pò zainstalowanim biblioteczi libpcsclite."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 31
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Smartcard Support"
msgstr "Òbsłëżnota Smartcard"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 42
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "&Enable smartcard support"
msgstr "&Włączë obsłëżnotã smartcard"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 61
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Enable &polling to autodetect card events"
msgstr "Włączë òd&pëtiwanié dlô aùtodetekcëji przëtrófków kôrtë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"In most cases you should have this enabled. It allows KDE to automatically "
"detect card insertion and reader hotplug events."
msgstr ""
"Zwëkòwò na òptacëjô mùszi bëc włączonô. Ùmòżebniô to aùtomatną detekcëjã "
"wkłôdónëch kôrtów w KDE. "

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Automatically &launch card manager if inserted card is unclaimed"
msgstr "&Aùtomatno zrëszë menadżer kôrtów, eżlë włożonô niewëzwëskòwóną kôrtã"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"When you insert a smartcard, KDE can automatically launch a management tool "
"if no other application attempts to use the card."
msgstr ""
"Eżlë niżódnô programa nie wëzwëskùjë włożony kôrtë, KDE mòże aùtomatno "
"zrëszëc nôrzãdze do sprôwiania kôrtama."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "&Beep on card insert and removal"
msgstr "&Zwãk przë wkłôdanim/wëcygniãcym kôrtë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 135
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "Readers"
msgstr "Czëtôrzë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 152
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Czëtôrz"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 163
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Ôrt"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 174
#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Subtype"
msgstr "Pòdôrt"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 185
#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "SubSubtype"
msgstr "Pòdpòdôrt"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 228
#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "PCSCLite Configuration"
msgstr "Kònfigùracëjô PCSCLite"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 251
#: rc.cpp:54
msgid ""
"To add new readers you have to modify /etc/readers.conf file and re-start "
"pcscd"
msgstr ""
"Abë dodac nowé czëtającé ùrzãdzenie, zmòdifikùjë lopk /etc/readers.conf ë "
"zrëszë znowa pcscd"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Mark Kwidzińsczi, Michôł Òstrowsczi"

#: rc.cpp:56
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "mark@linuxcsb.org, michol@linuxcsb.org"

